{
  "language": "java",
  "extensions": [".java"],
  "kinds": {
    "func": [
      { "type": "method_declaration" },
      { "type": "constructor_declaration" }
    ],
    "class": [
      { "type": "class_declaration" },
      { "type": "interface_declaration" },
      { "type": "enum_declaration" }
    ],
    "interface": [
      { "type": "interface_declaration" }
    ],
    "enum": [
      { "type": "enum_declaration" }
    ],
    "namespace": [
      { "type": "package_declaration" }
    ],
    "var": [
      { "type": "field_declaration" },
      { "type": "local_variable_declaration" }
    ],
    "comment": [
      { "type": "line_comment" },
      { "type": "block_comment" }
    ]
  },
  "notes": "Java no tiene una palabra clave 'const' real (lo más cercano es 'final', un modificador anidado dos niveles debajo de field_declaration, demasiado profundo para el filtro requires_child_type de un solo nivel) — los campos 'final' se filtran igual bajo 'var'."
}
